    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/55384a79d25cb370c75d8ae4354f0052.avif?t=1666496285\" /></div><br>&quot;Internet Generation&quot; is a beat 'em up action game, in which you will play as a newcomer to a chat server. Experience interesting things in this chaotic server, and use your keyboard to carry out your &quot;justice&quot;.<br>A moderator removed a r34 art? Beat them up!<br>Someone is flexing their pulls? Beat them up!<br>A simp is simping over VTubers? Beat them up!<br>Pick up your keyboard, and let us rip through the internet!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What you can do in this game:</h2>You will learn different skills by completing levels, and perform satisfying combo attacks with over 20 unique skill combinations.<br>Uppercut! Earthshatter! Show those unfortunate enemies which of these is more durable - their head, or your keyboard!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/fd262c7465e842376c260a9cd2d1979e.poster.avif?t=1666496285\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/fd262c7465e842376c260a9cd2d1979e.webm?t=1666496285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/fd262c7465e842376c260a9cd2d1979e.mp4?t=1666496285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You think you're bad at action games? Scared of getting stuck? No worries, we also have buffs in this game:<br>Use your [Virtuousness and braveness] to burn them all!<br>Show your [Uniqueness] to deal critical damage to your opponents!<br>Or ensure your [Political correctness] to become invincible!<br>And more than 20 other special buffs waiting for you to try them out.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/61cab62a9c9a467ccc5efec83279bc89.poster.avif?t=1666496285\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/61cab62a9c9a467ccc5efec83279bc89.webm?t=1666496285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/61cab62a9c9a467ccc5efec83279bc89.mp4?t=1666496285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/fbc63fe6d9532f8113f73114e96303c9.webp?t=1666496285\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What you can see in this game:</h2>There are many fantastic scenes of the internet in this game.<br>Pass through an internet sewerage network that can lead to anywhere;<br>Travel over a digital ocean made up of countless displays;<br>Explore a gigantic library filled with wires and hard-drives;<br>Hop between old-school TVs, and return to the world of memories.<br>And more magnificent scenes to be discovered.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/dd193f2e85475d0e2e95442c766af078.poster.avif?t=1666496285\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/dd193f2e85475d0e2e95442c766af078.webm?t=1666496285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Besides that, there also are cute character arts, nearly a thousand frames of hand-drawn pixel animations, a funny and vivid single-player story that is waiting for you to explore.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/55384a79d25cb370c75d8ae4354f0052.avif?t=1666496285\" /></div><br>&quot;Internet Generation&quot; is a beat 'em up action game, in which you will play as a newcomer to a chat server. Experience interesting things in this chaotic server, and use your keyboard to carry out your &quot;justice&quot;.<br>A moderator removed a r34 art? Beat them up!<br>Someone is flexing their pulls? Beat them up!<br>A simp is simping over VTubers? Beat them up!<br>Pick up your keyboard, and let us rip through the internet!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What you can do in this game:</h2>You will learn different skills by completing levels, and perform satisfying combo attacks with over 20 unique skill combinations.<br>Uppercut! Earthshatter! Show those unfortunate enemies which of these is more durable - their head, or your keyboard!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/fd262c7465e842376c260a9cd2d1979e.poster.avif?t=1666496285\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/fd262c7465e842376c260a9cd2d1979e.webm?t=1666496285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556980/extras/fd262c7465e842376c260a9cd2d1979e.mp4?t=1666496285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You think you're bad at action games? Scared of getting stuck? No worries, we also have buffs in this game:<br>Use your [Virtuousness and braveness] to burn them all!<br>Show your [Uniqueness] to deal critical damage to your opponents!<br>Or ensure your [Political correctness] to become invincible!<br>And more than 20 other special buffs waiting for you to try them out.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 